{"id":"659811","name":"创意黄灿灿的小花生","author":"putimama","authorId":"8334261","desc":"","cover":"images/659811/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"银栗窝瓜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"10g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"买个银栗窝瓜，切的时候十分费力，估评是非常面的那种窝瓜。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/04/2024070417200890320779368334261.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒸了4块窝瓜，果然是非常的面，还蒸了玉米。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/04/2024070417200891201913408334261.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":3,"desc":"瞬间想起做个纯窝瓜的美食，便将银栗窝瓜去剥去外皮，切成细条状，用刀捻压、捻了两遍(因为很面不能过细筛)这是一项细致活，软了不成型，得恰到好处。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/04/2024070417200892003745598334261.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":4,"desc":"捻成非常细腻且无颗粒状态，可根据需要适量放点糖。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/04/2024070417200893807128118334261.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":5,"desc":"分成2个剂子。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/04/2024070417200894255572688334261.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":6,"desc":"找了个花生型模具扣出，成品黄澄澄的很漂亮！","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/04/2024070417200894761349038334261.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"},{"step":7,"desc":"又做了一个，两个金灿灿小花生的，好可爱呀！颜值颇高！可直接食用。","img":"https://i3r.meishichina.com/atta/step/2024/07/04/2024070417200895870819698334261.jpg?x-oss-process=style/p320"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他、电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}